# Every entry here needs a reason and a review date. A bare CVE id with no
# justification is how a vulnerability gate quietly stops being a gate.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # why it does not apply here -- review: YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Empty on purpose: the runtime image installs no OS packages beyond the
# python:3.12-slim base, so nothing has needed an exception yet.
